From 7f04599d7039ae93f705f50b00805c360b9bfb60 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lizhilong <lizhilong22@huawei.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Jun 2026 16:29:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 30/71] feat(smap): supplement DT for smap_migrate_pages.c
 functions

Add 29 test cases to test_smap_migrate_pages.cpp covering:
- set_remote_migrate_mode: async/dma-offloading mode branches
- smap_check_huge_page_for_migration: !PageHead, wrong pid, correct pid
- cal_thread_time: start_time/end_time update logic
- init_mig: success, vzalloc failure
- put_folios: folio release verification
- smap_isolate_and_migrate_folios: success, failure, empty list
- is_filter_anon: huge page, non-anon
- smap_alloc_huge_page_node: mig_back and normal paths
- smap_alloc_new_node_page_mig_back: normal path
- smap_migrate: null/nr_folios=0, invalid node, back success
- migrate_multi_threaded: invalid thread count boundaries
- smap_migrate_numa: critical error, retry until success
- smap_migrate_range: vzalloc failure, pfn invalid

4 test cases removed for aarch64 reliability:
- TestIsFilterAnonMapcountGT1: page_mapcount inline in kernel
- TestSmapAllocNewNodePageMigBackHuge: mock fails on aarch64
- TestSmapAddPageMapcountRefuse: static + inline issue
- TestSmapAddPageFolioTryGetFail: static + inline issue

Fix aarch64 compilation: rename private->privat, nr_succeeded->ret_succeeded,
add extern declarations for PageAnon/folio_put, use (void*)nullptr for vzalloc.

Path: plugins/smap/test/tiering/test_smap_migrate_pages.cpp
---
